is absolutely continuous with respect to the law of an $\SLE_4(-1-u/\lambda ; -1+u/\lambda)$ in $V_{j,n}$ with the force points located at $a_{j,n}^-$ and $a_{j,n}^+$ respectively,  and stopped at the first time that it exits the aforementioned rectangle.  Also,  the choice of $u$ implies that such an ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:1feee9010657db8be5e12b5daf89407f40bda3e0973f882572b019a50582fa50","revision_digest":"sha256:c0633b62538f4d5a80275467a1613d1e43474fcc00c048238eab78a92c0c2548","source_id":"arxiv:2609.04140","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

{"artifact_digest":"sha256:474d3544f996e17f26042db5acde8fe5758c17dc56baf7f4231d5ed799a19e39","artifact_path":"objects/sha256/47/474d3544f996e17f26042db5acde8fe5758c17dc56baf7f4231d5ed799a19e39.md","bundle_digest":"sha256:15f35608905b614fd6011e747432cc2b1aefe7654de19765dbf6b645b59c6fa2","bundle_entry_key":"2412-03415-lemma-15-r-s","bundle_id":"population.tex-extract-s1_118","claim_kind":"lemma","conditions":[],"domain":"probability theory","draft":"tex-extract-v2-20260907/bundle_s1_118.json","evidence_ids":[],"logical_id":"math:harvest.arxiv.mathematics:arxiv-2412-03415-lem-15-r-s","overlay_schema_version":1,"proof_text":"Paper's own proof, opening: Since $W_n=\mathrm{Binomial}(V_n, p_c)$ and $S_n=\mathrm{Binomial}(V_n, 1-p_c)$, by standard large deviations for the Binomial distribution, for any $\epsilon>0$ there exist constants $c_1,c_2>0$ such that,
\begin{align*}
&\pr( |W_n - p_cV_n| \geqslant \epsilon p_c V_n ) \leqslant \exp(-c_1n), \\
&\pr( |S_n - (1-p_c)V_n| \geqslant \epsilon(1-p_c) V_n ) \leqslant \exp(-c_2n).
\end{align*} 
 Here we use the fact  $V_n\geqslant n$ to replace $V_n$ by $n$ in the exponent. Algebra then yields,
 \begin{align*}
  \pr\left( \bigg|\frac{S_n}{(1-p_c)V_n}-\frac{W_n}{p_c V_n}\bigg|\geqslant 2\epsilon\right) &\leqslant   \exp(-c_1n)+\exp(-c_2n)\leqslant 2\exp(-\min\{c_1,c_2\}n).
 \end{align*}
 Thus with ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:9804f4c5e8771315813cde16ed6ed7de051ad42dd5afa67b6eb914f58f1acd24","revision_digest":"sha256:c067ff8d21bd6a87c7008b5d2d699477624d1ee48c015f77ea1e43a79247a23b","source_id":"arxiv:2412.03415","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

