    \frac{g\left(V_{\pi}\left( \frac{i-1}{n}, \frac{\pi(i)-1}{n}  \right)  \right) - g\left( V_{\pi}\left( \frac{i-1}{n}, \frac{\pi(i)-1}{n}  \right) +\frac{1}{n} \right)}{g(\frac{i-1}{n})},
