[Theorem thm-MMinfty of arXiv:2505.00198, '\ttl'] Assume that $\mu>0 $ and $ \kappa >0$. 
The stationary distribution $\pi$ for the {\rm{M/M/}}$\infty$ queue with resetting is given by the following: for $n =0,1,2,\dots,$
\begin{equation} 
\pi_n = \frac{\theta^{n}}{n!} A_n, 

\end{equation}
where
\begin{equation} 
A_n = \int_0^1 \gamma (1-s)^{\gamma-1} s^n e^{-\theta s}ds. 
\end{equation}

