[Lemma Lemma-stat-meas-RWRE-homo of arXiv:2507.19222, 'Convergence of the KMP model to the KPZ equation'] The stationary measure of the Beta-RWRE on the finite segment $\{0,1,\ldots,N\}$ is given by 
		\begin{equation}
			\nu_{\text{stat}}=\bigotimes_{x=0}^{N}\nu_{\text{stat}}(x),\quad \text{where}\quad \nu_{\text{stat}}(x) \sim \mathrm{Gamma}(\alpha_{x}+\alpha_{x+1})\,.
		\end{equation}

