[Proposition 36 of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] Let $\Bessel_{\beta,a}=\{\lambda_{1,a}^B< \lambda_{2,a}^B< \cdots\}$, then we have 
\begin{align*}
\pr\Big(\lambda_{\lfloor a\rfloor,a}^B\le a^3\Big)\ge 1- O\big(a^{-3}\log (a+3)\big).
\end{align*}
The constant in the $O(\cdot)$ term only depends on $\beta$.

