[Lemma ker of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] If $f(x,y)$ is $RR_{2}$ and $k_{1}(x)\geq 0$, $k_{2}(y)\geq 0$,
then 
\begin{equation}
H(x,y)=k_{1}(x)\,k_{2}(y)\,f(x,y)  
\end{equation}
is $RR_{2}$.

