The first two itemized conditions depend only on $\widehat{\mathcal Z} |_{[0,n]}$. Hence, conditioning on $\widehat{\mathcal Z} |_{[0,n]}$ and $\{T_m = n\}$ is the same as ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:3bca7d86b3518b0c0a3ace21e0d2596b79c190794862c4526166e7879c7b9f42","revision_digest":"sha256:c66a785932130ec5c92c5222c33143ee5d793f3a9bda7e2c0a4c5806f660fd98","source_id":"arxiv:2510.26123","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

