body:
[Proposition of arXiv:2609.03959, 'The combinatorial Hopf algebra of signed graphs'] In the CHA of graphs ($\mathcal{G},\zeta$), let $\zeta_x$ be the deformation of $\zeta$ defined by $\zeta_x(G) = x^{|E|}$ for $G = (V,E)$ a graph. Then
    \begin{equation}
    D_G(x-1,t) = \zeta^{\ast t}_x (G).
    \end{equation}

