body:
[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2604.18871, 'Quantitative approximation of the Vlasov(--Fokker--Planck)--Navier--Stokes system by stoch'] Let $f\in H^\gamma_{p}(\T^d)$ with $\gamma>\frac{d}{p}$ and $\mu$ a probability measure on $\T^d\times \R^d$. Then there exists $C = C(\gamma,d,p)>0$ such that for any $N\in \N$ and any $(x,v)\in \T^d\times \R^d$,
\begin{align*}
\big|\vartheta^N \ast \big[(\bchi(f(x)) - \bchi(f)) \, \mu\big]\big|(x,v) \leq \frac{C}{N^{\beta(\gamma-\frac{d}{p})}} \lVert f\rVert_{\gamma,p}\, \vartheta^N \ast \mu(x,v).
\end{align*}

