[Theorem 4 (Normalization) of arXiv:2607.02108, 'A Two-Color Lift of the Shifted \texorpdfstring{$t$}{t}-Schur Measure'] The normalizing constant is
\begin{equation}
        Z_q(X,Y)=\Ht(qX;Y)\Ht(X;Y)=\Ht(X+qX;Y).
\end{equation}
For finite alphabets this is
\begin{equation}
        Z_q(X,Y)
        =\prod_{i,j}
        \frac{1+x_i y_j}{1-x_i y_j}
        \frac{1+q x_i y_j}{1-q x_i y_j}.
\end{equation}

