[Lemma lem::norma_2 of arXiv:2411.01467, 'Conformal covariance of connection probabilities \\ in the 2D critical FK-Ising model'] Let $y_1^a, y_2^a\in a\mathbb{Z}^2$ satisfy $\lim_{a\to 0}y_1^a=0$ and $\lim_{a\to 0}y_2^a=1$. Then
\begin{align*}
	\lim_{a\to 0} \frac{\mathbb{P}_{\mathbb{Z}^2}^a\left[y_1^a\longleftrightarrow y_2^a\right]}{\Big(\mathbb{P}_{\mathbb{Z}^2}^a\left[0\longleftrightarrow \partial B_1(0)\right]\Big)^2}=C,
\end{align*}
for some constant $C\in (0,\infty)$.

