as $|v| \to \infty$, for some $\eta > 0$. This decay follows directly from \eqref{laplace explicitee} and the estimate on the real part in","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:b92246d99059b2e742a82ca363f8eda94dc17ca69c8d9d4a7f664a69865d331d","revision_digest":"sha256:ca272aa01a825203a8368b1b49eb2c6196f86aaec3aa7d0cbac94aa9817ba443","source_id":"arxiv:2512.09136","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

