[Lemma lem:4.4 of arXiv:2412.01489, 'One- and two-particle spectral gap identities for the symmetric inclusion process and rela'] \sk{Assume that (equation eq:cond-far of the paper) holds, and} suppose that $\ell\in\bbr{1}{k}$, $m\in\bbr{1}{\ell}$
