    \node[node] (2) at (-0.5,-0.29) {};
    \node[node] (3) at (0.5,-0.29) {}; 
    \draw[edge] (1) to (2) ; 
    \draw[edge] (3) to (1) 
}, x, y)$ is symmetric if and only if $W$ is a degree-regular tournamenton.

