body:
[Lem qh1 of arXiv:2411.01849, 'A tamed-adaptive Milstein scheme for stochastic differential equations with low regularity'] For any $q>1$, there exists a positive constant $\widehat{C}_0$ which does not depend on $\Delta$ such that, for any $t>0$, 
\begin{align}

	\mathbb{E} \left[\left|\widehat{X}_{\underline{t}}\right|^q\right] \le 4 ^{q-1}\left(\mathbb{E}\left[|\widehat{X}_t|^q\right] +\widehat{C}_0 \right).
	\end{align}

