body:
[Lemma lm:EXtwosquaredfinite of arXiv:2601.09537, 'Gene genealogies in haploid populations evolving according to sweepstakes reproduction'] For  $X$ a positive integer-valued  random variable with law given by Eq~(equation eq:4 of the paper) and $\alpha > 2$ we have
\begin{displaymath}
\ensuremath{\mathds{E}\left[ X^2 \right]} < \infty 
\end{displaymath}

