[Defn def:T of arXiv:2509.26254, '$K$-Branching Random Walk with Noisy Selection: \\ \Large Large Population Limits and Phas'] Suppose $\bm{x} \in \mathbb{R}^{K+1}$ is a non-increasing vector, that is,
