[Lemma 38 of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] Assume $a_n\ge 10/\beta+8$ and $2a_n/n\le \eps_n\le 1$. Then we have
   \begin{align*}
       \ev[\|\mathsf{k}_{\beta,2a_n}^{(n)} \ind(\max(x,y)>1-\eps_n) \|_2^2]\le \frac{2\eps_n}{a_n}.
   \end{align*}

