(\Gamma_{xy})_{\beta}^{\gamma}$ together with \eqref{eq_tri_supp2}, which
yields 
\begin{equation}
\begin{aligned}
\EE^{\frac{1}{p}}
\left|
( \Gamma_{xy})_{ \beta}^{\gamma}
\right|^{p} 
\lesssim
\sum_{m =0}^{ \infty}
\sum_{\n_{1}, \ldots, \n_{m}}
\sum_{ \beta_{1}+ \cdots + \beta_{m+1}= \beta}
\EE^{\frac{1}{p}}
\left|
\pi^{( \n_{1 })}_{ \beta_{1}}\cdots \pi^{ ( \n_{m})}_{ \beta_{m}}\right|^{p} 
\delta_{ \beta_{m+1}}^{\gamma - \delta_{\n_{1}}- \cdots - \delta_{\n_{m}}}\,,
