To ease notations we assume $x_0=0$ (and thus $0 \not\in S$).
Consider for any unit vector $u$ the cone with opening angle $\theta$ and axis $u$ defined by
\[
\cone(u) =  \{x \in \R^d   : x \cdot u \ge \cos(\theta) \|x\|\}.
\]
As $\theta$ is small enough, 
\begin{equation}

