|x|&=|\lambda_i|/ |\prod_{k \in [1,k_{i,j}] \setminus\{l_{i,j}\}} x_{k}|, \\
Spec(x)&=Spec(x_{k})=\{{\lambda}_{1},\ {\lambda}_{2},\ \ldots ,\ {\lambda}_{n} \}
\end{aligned}
\right.
\end{equation*}
($k \in [1,k_{i,j}] \setminus \{ l_{i,j}\},\ j \in [1, n_i],\  i \in [1,n]$). Since $x_k$'s are indistinguishable by their spactra, we identify them all. The defining system of equations for $m$ is then given by
