\[
\E \vert H_k(x) \vert = \sum_{m=1}^{t-1} {\vert \Gamma_{k-1}(x) \vert \choose m} { n- \vert N_{k-1}(x) \vert\choose t- m} p,
\]
as $m$ points of each edge are chosen from $\Gamma_{k-1}(x)$ and the rest of the $(t-m)$ points are chosen from $N_{k-1}(x)^c$.
