[Lemma lem:stopped_Holder_continuity of arXiv:2411.09482, 'Anomalous Regularization in Kazantsev-Kraichnan Model'] Fix $\gamma \in \left(0, \frac 12\right)$, $p\ge1$. Then, for every $R>0$ it holds
	\begin{equation*}
		\sup_{\nu \in (0,1]} \mathbb{E} \left[ \|M^{\nu,R} \|^p_{C^\gamma([0,T];H^{-s-2})} \right] \lesssim_{\gamma,p, T} R^p
	\end{equation*}

