[Proposition 14 of arXiv:2602.14618, 'Finitary coding and Gaussian concentration\\ for random fields'] Under the same condition as in Theorem \ref{main-thm-ffiid}, we have
\begin{equation*}
\E \sum_{i\in\dep(g^{(n)})} \big(c_i^{(n)}(X)\big)^2
\leq \|\delta f\|_2^2\, \|b\|_1,
\end{equation*}
where for all $j \in \Z^d$, 
\begin{equation} 
b_j =  \E\sum_{i\in\Z^d} \1\!\left\{\|i\|_\infty\le r_0^{(n)}(X)\right\} \1\!\left\{\|j-i\|_\infty\le r_j^{(n)}(X)\right\}\,.
\end{equation}

