[Theorem 7 (Fast regret of online MYULA) of arXiv:2608.25706, 'Fast rates in Bayesian online learning with approximate posteriors'] Under the same assumptions of \cref{thm:linear-statistical}, the approximate posterior computed by \cref{alg:proximal} satisfies
