  \end{equation*}
  is supported on $\{x\} \cup S_{1}^{\pp -}(\hat{x})$.

  By the induction hypothesis $\left\langle \b 1_{x}, \b U_{0}(y)\right\rangle$ with $y \succ x$, is
  non-zero only if $x \in S_{1}^{\pp -}(\hat{y})$, i.e.\ $x$ and $y$ are
  siblings. Thus,
