Theorem~\ref{thm:geom-covariance-block-transfer}, for every $p\ge2$ and
$2\le r<\infty$,
\begin{equation}

 \|A_{L,a}M_{\Phi_{m,\nu}}B_{Q,b}\|_{L^p(\Omega;\Sch_r)}
 \lesssim_m
 (p+r)^{m/2}\mathfrak c(L\vee Q)^{m/2}
 \min\{L,Q\}^{d/r}L^{-a}Q^{-b}.
\end{equation}

