$$ W(\omega;s,y) = \Lambda(\omega) \Ind_{(t,t']}(s) \Ind_A(y)$$
with an $\ccF^Y_t$-measurable random variable $\Lambda$ and $A\in \ccB(\R^n)$ we obtain that
