$\mathbb G$ starting from the identity $e$, and let
$\mathcal C_e^+(\beta,\rho;X)$ be as in
Definition~(def:oriented_cone_horiz of the paper). Then
\begin{align}
\inf_{\substack{X\in V_1\\ |X|=1}}
\operatorname{Vol}(\mathcal C_e^+(\beta,\rho;X))
>0.
\end{align}
Moreover, for every fixed $t>0$,
\begin{align}
\inf_{\substack{X\in V_1\\ |X|=1}}
\mathbb P_e\bigl(B_t\in\mathcal C_e^+(\beta,\rho;X)\bigr)
>0.
\end{align}

