[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2607.22438, 'A deterministic scalar reduction for the phase transition in two interacting urns'] The function \(h'\) is symmetric about \(1/2\) and strictly decreases as \(|t-1/2|\) increases. In particular,
\begin{equation*}
 h''(t)<0,
 \qquad\text{for all } t\in\left(\frac12,1\right).
\end{equation*}

