[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2609.02790, 'Full-Model Optimality for Tunable Linear Generative Priors in Compressed Sensing'] Under Lemma \ref{Under_E(k)} assumptions, let $T_2(k)=\Big\|G_k(A_kG_k)^{\dagger}\Big\|_F^2$. For all $ m \leq k$,
\begin{align}
  T_2(k) - T_2(k-1)&= \sum_{i=1}^{k-1}(\sigma_i^2-\sigma_k^2)\Big(M_k^{\dagger}\big(M_k{^{\dagger}}\big)^T-M_{k-1}^{\dagger}\big(M_{k-1}{^{\dagger}}\big)^T\Big)_{ii}+\sigma_k^2\bigg(\Tr\Big(M_{k}^{\dagger}\big(M_{k}{^{\dagger}}\big)^T\Big)-\Tr \Big(M_{k-1}^{\dagger}\big(M_{k-1}{^{\dagger}}\big)^T\Big)\bigg)\nonumber\\
  &\leq 0 
\end{align}
and as a consequence,
\begin{align}
\Big\|G_k(A_kG_k)^{\dagger}\Big\|_F^2\sum_{i=k+1}^n\sigma_i^2   
\end{align}
is monotonically decreasing.

