[Theorem 11 of arXiv:2506.16260, 'Fractional Compound Poisson Random Fields on Plane'] The distribution of STFPRF is given by
	\begin{equation}
		p_{\alpha_1,\alpha_2}^\beta(n,t_1,t_2)=\frac{(-1)^n}{n!}{}_3\Psi_3\Bigg[\begin{matrix}
			(1,\beta),&(1,1),&(1,1)\\\\
			(1-n,\beta),&(1,\alpha_1),&(1,\alpha_2)
		\end{matrix}\bigg|-t_1^{\alpha_1}t_2^{\alpha_2}\lambda^\beta\Bigg],\ n\ge0.
	\end{equation}

