[Lemma lem: threshold for general initial condition of arXiv:2608.23756, 'Measure-valued fluid limits for partial service queues\\with correlated patience and servi'] If $\boldsymbol{\mu} \in \mathcal{S}^+$ and $y_*$ is defined as in (equation eq: equilibrium threshold of the paper), then
	\begin{equation*}
		\bar y_*\left(\boldsymbol{\mu}_t\right) \geq t \quad \text{for all} \quad t \in [0, y_*) \quad \text{and} \quad \bar y_*\left(\boldsymbol{\mu}_t\right) = y_* \quad \text{for all} \quad t \geq y_*.
	\end{equation*}

