[Lemma 32 of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] Let $a\in[1/2,1]$. Then for all $r\in[0,1]$,
\begin{equation*}
    \Beta\left(\frac{r}{1+r};a,a\right)\le \frac{r^a}{a}.
\end{equation*}

