body:
[Lemma lem : FdTmon/Intrinsic/Pgrad of arXiv:2412.03320, 'Large deviation principle at speed $n$ for the random metric in first-passage percolation'] Assume that $\FdTmon(D)<\infty$. Then for $\hd$-almost all $z\inX \setminus\bigcup_{k\ge 1}\sigma_k$,
	\begin{equation}
		(\Pgrad D)_z = \mu,
	\end{equation}
	and for all $k\ge 1$, for $\hd$-almost all $z  = \sigma_k(t)\in \sigma_k$, for all $u\in \mathbb{R}^d \setminus \p{\sigma_k'(t)\mathbb{R} }$,
	\begin{equation}
		(\Pgrad D)_z(u) = \mu(u).
	\end{equation}

