body:
[Cor 42 of arXiv:2606.13459, 'Symmetric Cooperative Motion in Higher Dimensions'] For an interval $I \subset \R$, let $w,z \in L^{1}(\R^{d} \times I) \cap C(I;L^{1}(\R^{d}))$. Then
	\begin{equation*}
		w \overset{a.e.}{=} z \text{ in }\R^{d} \times I \text{ if and only if } w(\cdot,t) \overset{a.e.}{=} z(\cdot,t) \text{ in } \R^{d} \text{ for all } t \in I.
	\end{equation*}

