[Lem 12 of arXiv:2608.29148, '2608.29148'] Modulo negligible terms, we have
\begin{equation}
\begin{aligned}
2F^-_{\infty0}&\equiv -r\pa_r \psi'_0+O(r^3), \\
2F^-_{\infty1}&\equiv -(r\pa_r-1)\psi_1+O(r^3),
\end{aligned}
\end{equation}
where the terms $O(r^3)$ in the right-hand sides do not involve $\psi_0', \psi_1$.

