			As a consequence, $E_d({\scaleobj{1}{\square}}_m) \subseteq E_d(\mathscr{C}_{\operatorname{bc}}^{\widetilde{\mathbf{a}}^\delta_{m}}({\scaleobj{1}{\square}}_m))$. Moreover, we have an expansion for $\mathbb{E}[\widetilde \Delta_m^{\delta, (1)}]$ that 
