[Corollary Eq:4.12 of arXiv:2412.08964, 'Phase transition and critical behavior in hierarchical\\integer-valued Gaussian and Coulom'] The sequence $\{M_k\}_{k=0}^{ n+1}$ defined by $M_0:=\phi_0$ and by
\begin{equation}

