[Theorem 10 of arXiv:2605.30869, 'Approximate Transitivity of Young Translation on Rough Paths'] For any  $\fX\in \cC^{0;p\text{-var}}_{\mathbf{1}}$  the sequence $(h^n)$ in Theorem \ref{thm_main_rigorous} can be taken such that \begin{equation}
\rho_{p\text{-var}}((\mathbf X\boxplus h^n),\mathbf 1)\to 0\,.
	\end{equation}
	Moreover if $\mathbf{X} \in \mathcal{C}^{0;\alpha}_{\mathbf{1}}$ the same result holds with the metric $\rho_{\alpha} $.

