[Lemma 36 of arXiv:2605.14630, '2605.14630'] Assume $f\in\H^{\otimes n}$, and $g = g_1\otimes g_2\in\H^{\otimes m}$
with $g_1\in\H^{\otimes(m-1)}$ and $g_2\in\H$. Then 
one has 
\begin{equation}
 f \star_p g 
 = \indicator{p\neq0} (f\star_{p-1} g_1)\star_1 g_2 
 + \indicator{p\neq m} (f\star_p g_1)\otimes g_2
 \qquad 
 \text{for $0\leqs p\leqs m$\;.} 
\end{equation}

