As a consequence we have that $ M(t) \leq M(0) $ and the desired conclusion follows. The same argument can be adapted to prove the statement for the subsolutions (equation subsolution trunc of the","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:828cc74351dc5ad0f39fd7878ba15651a8292382bf3c7a1141718e0058988c56","revision_digest":"sha256:e7cf3c42ea78ea55fed4abbe8ebfb7c165da0d23c78530bd74c3b3525fd4ab63","source_id":"arxiv:2607.02367","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

