[Lemma lem:estimateofaverage of arXiv:2604.22510, 'Asymptotics of Multi-Scale McKean--Vlasov Diffusions with Super-Linear Kernels: a Lifted S'] For any $T>0,p\geq 2$, we have
		\begin{equation}
			{\cal E}\Big[\sup_{t\in [0,T]}|\bar{X}_t|^p\Big]\lesssim_{p,T}(1+{\cal E}|\xi|^p),
		\end{equation}
		\begin{equation}
			\sup_{t\in[0,T]}{\cal E}|\bar{X}_t-\bar{X}_{t(\Delta)}|^2\lesssim_{T,\xi}\Delta^{2}.
