[Lemma lem: upsilon2 b of arXiv:2506.21466, 'The Markov property for $\varphi^4_3$ on the cylinder'] For every $\alpha \in (0,1)$, there exists $C>0$ such that, for every admissible boundary law $\mathbb P^0$ and every $T>0$,
\begin{equation} 
\mathbb E_{\mathbb P^0\otimes \mathbb P^0} [|\Upsilon_{2,T}^b(W^0_-,Z^0_-,W^0_+,Z^0_-)|^\alpha]\leq C + \mathbb E_{\mathbb P^0\otimes\mathbb P^0}[\|Z^0_+\|_{H^{1/2-\kappa}_z}^2+\|Z^0_-\|_{H^{1/2-\kappa}_z}^2]. 
\end{equation}

