[Lemma 26 of arXiv:2608.03497, 'Connective Constants on Nested Fractal Graphs'] For \(j=0,1\), let
\[
  \mathcal E_s^{(j)}
  =
  \#\{w\in\cW_{O,s}:m_+(w)\le j\}.
\]
Then, for every \(n\ge1\),
\begin{equation}
  c_{n+h}
  =
  \mathcal E_{n+h}^{(0)}
  +
  \sum_{w\in\cW_{O,n}}
  \frac{m_-(w)}{m_+(w)+1},

\end{equation}
and
\begin{equation}
  c_{n+2h}
  =
  \mathcal E_{n+2h}^{(1)}
  +
  \sum_{w\in\cW_{O,n}}
