\end{align*}
Hence, from Lemma (lem_zb1 of the paper),
\begin{align}
    \lim_{t\to 0^+} \frac{1-p_t^D(x,D)}{t} = \nu(x,D^c).
\end{align}
Combining (equation eq:G1 of the paper) and (equation eq:G2 of the paper) we obtain the following equality
\begin{align*}
